<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Bennett Luxe Stays | Bennett Property Group, LLC</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bennett Luxe Stays transforms your property into a high-yield luxury retreat. Guaranteed rental income, expert property care, and a stress-free ownership experience." />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="logo.png" />

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --gold: #b8894a;
    --gold-light: #d4a968;
    --gold-soft: #e8d5ae;
    --ink: #1a1a1a;
    --ink-soft: #4a4a4a;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-cream: #faf8f3;
    --bg-warm: #f5f0e6;
    --muted: #8a8278;
    --line: rgba(26,26,26,.1);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--bg);
    line-height:1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    font-weight:300;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}

  .container{width:min(1180px,90%);margin-inline:auto;}
  .container-narrow{width:min(820px,90%);margin-inline:auto;}

  /* NAV — always white */
  header.nav{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;
    padding:22px 0;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,1);
    box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line);
    transition: padding .4s ease;
  }
  header.nav.scrolled{
    padding:14px 0;
  }
  .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;}
  .brand-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.15;}
  .brand-text .a{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:26px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.01em;}
  .brand-text .b{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}

  nav.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;}
  nav.links a{
    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink);font-weight:400;padding:6px 0;transition:color .3s;
  }
  nav.links a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    padding:15px 30px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;
    text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;
    transition:all .35s ease;cursor:pointer;border:none;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#fff;}
  .btn-gold:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;}
  .btn-light{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);}
  .btn-light:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;}

  .mobile-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;z-index:101;}
  .mobile-toggle span{display:block;width:26px;height:1.5px;background:var(--ink);margin:6px 0;transition:all .3s;}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    position:relative;min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;padding:140px 0 100px;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(26,26,26,.38) 0%,rgba(26,26,26,.58) 100%),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{
    font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold-soft);margin-bottom:32px;font-weight:400;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:400;
    font-size:clamp(42px,6.2vw,90px);line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:34px;
    max-width:1000px;margin-inline:auto;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:300;}
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size:clamp(15px,1.15vw,17px);max-width:600px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);margin:0 auto 44px;
    font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;
  }
  .hero-actions{display:inline-flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;}
  .hero-scroll{
    position:absolute;bottom:36px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;
  }
  .hero-scroll .dot{
    width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold-soft);
    animation:pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.4;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.3);}}

  /* SHARED */
  section{padding:130px 0;position:relative;}
  .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:22px;display:block;}
  .heading{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(32px,4.2vw,58px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.012em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:30px;}
  .heading em{font-style:italic;font-weight:300;}
  .divider{width:60px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);margin:0 auto 40px;}
  .section-head{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 80px;text-align:center;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;}

  /* INTRO */
  .intro{background:var(--bg);padding:140px 0 60px;text-align:center;}
  .intro .heading{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto 40px;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,50px);}
  .intro p{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;}

  /* ABOUT IMAGES */
  .about-imgs-section{background:var(--bg);padding:0 0 130px;}
  .about-imgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-bottom:80px;}
  .about-imgs .img-wrap{overflow:hidden;}
  .about-imgs .img-wrap img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);}
  .about-imgs .img-wrap:hover img{transform:scale(1.04);}
  .about-imgs .mid{transform:translateY(40px);}
  .about-text-block{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;padding-top:40px;}
  .about-text-block p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.85;}

  /* FEATURES */
  .features{background:var(--bg-cream);}
  .features-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:60px 50px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}
  .feature{text-align:center;padding:0 10px;}
  .feature-icon{width:68px;height:68px;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 28px;color:var(--gold);transition:all .4s ease;}
  .feature:hover .feature-icon{background:var(--gold);color:#fff;transform:rotate(-8deg);}
  .feature h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.25;}
  .feature p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;}

  /* VALUES */
  .values{background:var(--bg-warm);}
  .values-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px;align-items:center;}
  .values-img{height:560px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
  .values-img::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-20px;left:-20px;right:20px;bottom:20px;border:1px solid var(--gold);z-index:0;pointer-events:none;}
  .values-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;position:relative;z-index:1;transition:transform 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);}
  .values-img:hover img{transform:scale(1.04);}
  .value-block{margin-bottom:36px;}
  .value-block:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .value-block h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--ink);}
  .value-block p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;}

  /* MID CTA */
  .mid-cta{background:var(--bg);text-align:center;padding:120px 0;}
  .mid-cta .heading{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto 40px;}

  /* PORTFOLIO */
  .portfolio{background:var(--bg-cream);}
  .portfolio-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}
  .p-item{position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:1;cursor:pointer;}
  .p-item img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);}
  .p-item::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(26,26,26,0);transition:background .4s;}
  .p-item:hover img{transform:scale(1.06);}
  .p-item:hover::after{background:rgba(26,26,26,.2);}

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testimonials{background:var(--bg);}
  .testi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;}
  .testi{background:var(--bg-cream);padding:44px 36px;border-top:2px solid var(--gold);position:relative;transition:transform .4s ease;}
  .testi:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);}
  .testi .qmark{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:72px;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;position:absolute;top:18px;right:26px;opacity:.3;}
  .testi blockquote{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:28px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .testi .author{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
  .testi .avatar{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:20px;}
  .testi .name{font-weight:500;font-size:14px;}
  .testi .role{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;}

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .final-cta{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:140px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .final-cta::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 30%,rgba(184,137,74,.15),transparent 50%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 70%,rgba(184,137,74,.1),transparent 50%);}
  .final-cta .container{position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .final-cta .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-light);}
  .final-cta .heading{color:#fff;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
  .final-cta p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 44px;font-size:16px;}

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact{background:var(--bg);}
  .contact-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start;}
  .contact-info p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:30px;max-width:440px;}
  .c-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .c-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .c-ico{width:44px;height:44px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--gold);}
  .c-row .l{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .c-row .v{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);}

  form.cf{background:var(--bg-cream);padding:50px 44px;}
  form.cf h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:30px;}
  .frow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .ff{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .ff.full{grid-column:1/-1;}
  .ff label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:500;}
  .ff input,.ff textarea{background:transparent;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .3s;font-weight:300;resize:vertical;}
  .ff input:focus,.ff textarea:focus{outline:none;border-bottom-color:var(--gold);}
  .ff textarea{min-height:90px;}
  form.cf .btn{margin-top:10px;width:100%;justify-content:center;}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{background:var(--ink);color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:70px 0 30px;text-align:center;}
  .logo-f{height:90px;margin:0 auto 24px;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);}
  .f-name{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:#fff;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .f-sub{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-light);margin-bottom:36px;}
  .f-links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:36px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:40px;padding-bottom:40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
  .f-links a{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);transition:color .3s;}
  .f-links a:hover{color:var(--gold-light);}
  .copyright{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;}

  /* ANIMATIONS */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:all 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);}
  .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
  .hero>div>*{opacity:0;animation:heroIn 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) forwards;}
  .hero>div>*:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.2s;}
  .hero>div>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.45s;}
  .hero>div>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.7s;}
  .hero>div>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.95s;}
  @keyframes heroIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media(max-width:900px){
    section{padding:80px 0;}
    .intro{padding:90px 0 40px;}
    .mobile-toggle{display:block;}
    nav.links{
      position:fixed;top:0;right:0;background:#fff;
      width:100%;height:100vh;flex-direction:column;
      justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:40px;
      transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);gap:30px;
    }
    nav.links.open{transform:translateX(0);}
    nav.links a{font-size:16px;}
    .mobile-toggle.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7.5px) rotate(45deg);}
    .mobile-toggle.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0;}
    .mobile-toggle.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7.5px) rotate(-45deg);}
    .features-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:50px;}
    .values-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:50px;}
    .values-img{height:360px;}
    .values-img::before{display:none;}
    .contact-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:50px;}
    .about-imgs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .about-imgs .mid{display:none;}
    .portfolio-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .frow{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    form.cf{padding:36px 26px;}
    .brand-text .a{font-size:20px;}
  }
  @media(max-width:500px){
    .hero-actions{flex-direction:column;width:100%;}
    .hero-actions .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center;}
    .portfolio-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="brand-text">
      <span class="a">Bennett Luxe Stays</span>
      <span class="b">Bennett Property Group, LLC</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#why">Why Us</a>
      <a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="mobile-toggle" id="mobileToggle" aria-label="Menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Committed to Your Property</div>
    <h1>Maximize Your Property's Potential With <em>Bennett Luxe Stays</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">Enjoy guaranteed rental income, expert property care, and a stress-free ownership experience while we transform your home into a high-yield luxury retreat. Let your property work for you — effortlessly.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get in Touch</a>
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-light">Discover More</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll"><span>Scroll</span><div class="dot"></div></div>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="intro" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
      <h2 class="heading">Let Your Property Work for You: <br><em>Stress-Free &amp; Profitable.</em></h2>
      <p>At Bennett Luxe Stays, we specialize in maximizing property value while eliminating the stress of traditional rentals. Our mission is to provide homeowners with guaranteed income, expert property care, and a seamless hosting experience — all while delivering exceptional stays for business professionals, corporate travelers, and high-end guests.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT IMAGES — interior photos -->
<section class="about-imgs-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-imgs reveal">
      <div class="img-wrap">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616594039964-ae9021a400a0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Luxury interior" />
      </div>
      <div class="img-wrap mid">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Luxury bathroom" />
      </div>
      <div class="img-wrap">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Luxury living room" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text-block reveal">
      <p>We handle every detail — from maintenance and security to guest management and financial stability — so you can enjoy consistent earnings without the hassle of tenant turnover, vacancies, or property upkeep.</p>
      <p>Whether you're looking to optimize a single home or expand your real estate portfolio, we transform properties into high-performing luxury retreats — effortlessly. With comprehensive insurance, advanced safety measures, and seamless property care, your home stays protected, well-maintained, and continuously occupied.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Partner With Us</span>
      <h2 class="heading">The Bennett <em>Difference</em></h2>
      <p>We go beyond traditional rentals — turning your property into a profitable, worry-free investment. Our expert team handles everything from security and maintenance to guest management and financial stability.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 9-8 10-4.5-1-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>$2M Property Protection</h3>
        <p>Your investment is fully covered with comprehensive insurance up to $2 million, ensuring security against unforeseen risks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Top-Tier Security</h3>
        <p>24/7 monitoring, smart lock technology, and real-time noise detection provide complete protection for your home and guests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><path d="M9 22V12h6v10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Premium Property Care</h3>
        <p>Our professional team keeps your property meticulously maintained and guest-ready at all times, reducing long-term wear and tear.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M12 1v22M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Guaranteed Income</h3>
        <p>Say goodbye to late payments — our guaranteed rental model ensures steady, on-time earnings every single month.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 14l4-4 4 4 5-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Zero Vacancy Costs</h3>
        <p>We handle cleaning, maintenance, and guest transitions to keep your property occupied and generating revenue year-round.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20M7 15h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Stable Financial Returns</h3>
        <p>Our strong financial backing means you'll enjoy dependable earnings regardless of market trends or seasonal fluctuations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="values">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="values-inner">
      <div class="values-img reveal">
